WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Good evening.

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.770 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is, as always,
great to hear.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:06.873 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.709 size:78% position:39%
The Electoral College
met today to affirm

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.077 line:92%
President-elect Joe Biden's win.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
Great! The guy hasn't even
taken office yet,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
but his election victory
is already in its second term.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:19.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're going to be seeing
articles about Biden fatigue

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.353 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
before Christmas.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Wall Street Journal"
published an op-ed on Friday

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
that said future First Lady,
Dr. Jill Biden,

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
should not use
the honorific "Doctor"

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
because she has
a PhD in education

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.131 line:92%
and is not a medical doctor.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:34.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
It also asked her to
start going by Mrs. Woman,

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
and if they need her attention
they'll just point at her.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
After several
news outlets reported

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
that top White House officials
were scheduled

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
to begin receiving the
coronavirus vaccine this week,

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
tweeted last night

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:48.648
that he didn't want staffers
receiving injections early -

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
not unless they can figure out
a way to overturn

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.186 line:92%
the results of the election.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.354 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Uh-oh!

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's time for
a smart-joke alert.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:00.960 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Alarm blaring ]

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think, technically,
it's time for a smart joke

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:07.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then there
would be an alert.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right -- several
news outlets reported yesterda

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
that top White House
officials were scheduled

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:15.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
to begin receiving the
coronavirus vaccine this week.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:21.514
Well, you know what they say -
to the vector go the spoils.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I mean, it's smart.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:27.687 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Not sure it's a joke.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:34.461
That joke can call itself
"Doctor," for all I care.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:36.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
The pharmaceutical company
Pfizer, yesterday,

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:40.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
began shipping its newly
approved coronavirus vaccine

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.234 line:92%
from a facility in Michiga

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
with protection from
the U.S. Marshals Service.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said one U.S. Marshal,
"Oh, these?

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.807 size:75% position:38% line:92%
No. These are PS5s."

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:51.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
In a new editorial --
Why do they have U.S. Marshals

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.147 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"Give us those vaccines!

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:58.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got the vaccines, Bob.
I don't know.

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:00.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
much about them at all.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:03.790 line:92%
I heard this vector joke."

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.025
In a new editorial today,
"The Wall Street Journal"

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.495
called on President Trump
to concede the election,

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
but they wanted to
make sure he saw it,

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.932 line:92%
so they published it in "Maxim."

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:16.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York Governor --
[ Laughs ]

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
announced on Friday

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:22.542
that he would halt indoor dining
at bars and restaurants

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:25.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
across the state to stop
the spread of the coronavirus.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:28.748
So, of course, that only applies
to indoor-indoor dining,

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.217 line:92%
not outdoor-indoor dining.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.786 size:75% position:38%
A hospital in Latvia
recently installed

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:34.954 line:92%
an automated vending machine

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
that dispenses
coronavirus test kits.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
While, in America,
we don't have that,

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
and no one knows
where Latvia is.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to a new study,
dogs can detect

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
the presence of the coronaviru
in human sweat.

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
So maybe it's best Trump
didn't get a dog,

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:55.642 size:84% position:42%
because it would have
barked itself to death.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Cleveland Indians
baseball team

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.347
has reportedly decided to change
its name after 105 years.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:02.715 line:92%
So Cleveland is doing it.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
Washington's football team
is doing it.

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:07.120 line:92%
Ball's in your court, Indiana.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.021 line:92%
Wally, I didn't know they were

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
also changing the name
of Cleveland.

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:12.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
Could we look at the card
real quick?

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.459 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Can we go back one card?

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-There we go.

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:19.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
Definitely not the spellin
of Cleveland.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:22.468
-Isn't it known for knives
-Can we flip back one more card?

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:25.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can we go back one more card
-Yeah, sure.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:30.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got it wrong twice.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:36.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The consistency is what
I respect out of it.

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:40.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally -- We got to ge
an alert for Wally.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally,
Disney announced last week

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
that actor Harrison Ford
will return

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a fifth "Indiana Jones
movie in July 2022.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
In this one,
he breaks into a tomb

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then tries to remember
why he went in there.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:54.434 size:84% position:42%
And that, you guys --
that was the monologue.

